 'fuel-delivery':['Which fuel should I request?','Check the fuel type specified for your vehicle and confirm delivery availability with dispatch.'],
 'local-hauling':['Can I schedule a vehicle move?','Share your pickup window and both locations to discuss scheduling and compatibility.'],
